# Heavy ML Model Weights — NEVER commit these (violates AGENTS.md Rule 1 — No Bloat)
# These are auto-downloaded at runtime by the subsystem C (sutra_perception) detector_node.py
# To manually download: pip install ultralytics && python3 -c "from ultralytics import YOLO; YOLO('yolov8n.pt')"
# Or run: python3 sutra_ws/src/sutra_perception/scripts/download_weights.py
*.pt
*.onnx
*.engine
*.trt
*.weights
*.bin
yolov8*.pt

